rem Luxury Hampers
rem https://projecteuler.net/problem=236
rem Two suppliers send five products
rem each, A and B, in the amounts below.
rem The spoiled share of each product is
rem m times higher for B than for A, yet
rem the total share is m times higher
rem for A. Find the largest m as u/v.

use numbers
use sequences
use text
use io
use cli

arg Top integer = 5248

rem With a spoiled of A and b of B for a
rem product, b / B = m a / A, so product
rem 1 gives m = 41 b / (5 a) for a up to
rem Top and b up to 640: these are the m
rem to test. For m = u / v the products
rem fall in three groups of equal B / A:
rem 5/41, 59/41 and 59/90, so the
rem spoiled a = d t and b = n t for each
rem product, with n/d the ratio of its
rem group times m, and t from 1 up to a
rem bound. Sums of t in a group may take
rem every value between the number of
rem products and the sum of the bounds,
rem and the total share gives one
rem equation c0 s0 + c1 s1 + c2 s2 = 0,
rem tried over bounded s0 and s2, with
rem s1 determined by exact division.
Ap = array 5248 1312 2624 5760 3936
Bp = array 640 1888 3776 3776 5664
Gi = array 0 1 1 2 1
Gb = array 5 59 59
Ga = array 41 41 90
Sa = 18880
Sb = 15744
Gn = array shape 3 fill 0
Gd = array shape 3 fill 0
Lo = array shape 3 fill 0
Hi = array shape 3 fill 0
Cc = array shape 3 fill 0
Bu = 1
Bv = 1
Cnt = 0
for A in 1 to Top
  for B in 1 to 640
    U = 41 * B
    V = 5 * A
    if U at most V
      continue
    end
    if A gcd B not equal 1
      continue
    end
    G1 = U gcd V
    U = U // G1
    V = V // G1
    rem Cake and port denominators must
    rem fit their respective stocks.
    if 5 * A // (59 * B gcd (5 * A)) greater 1312
      continue
    end
    if 450 * A // (2419 * B gcd (450 * A)) greater 5760
      continue
    end
    Ok = 1
    for G in 0 to 2
      N = U * Gb G
      D = V * Ga G
      G1 = N gcd D
      Gn G = N // G1
      Gd G = D // G1
      Lo G = 0
      Hi G = 0
      Cd = V * Sb * D
      Cn = U * Sa * N
      Cc G = (Cd - Cn) // G1
    end
    for I in 0 to 4
      G = Gi I
      Ub = Ap I // (Gd G)
      Ub2 = Bp I // (Gn G)
      if Ub2 less Ub
        Ub = Ub2
      end
      if Ub less 1
        Ok = 0
      end
      Lo G += 1
      Hi G += Ub
    end
    if Ok equal 0
      continue
    end
    C0 = Cc 0
    C1 = Cc 1
    C2 = Cc 2
    Gc = (C0 gcd C1) gcd C2
    C0 = C0 // Gc
    C1 = C1 // Gc
    C2 = C2 // Gc
    rem C1 is negative for m > 1:
    rem Sb * 41 is less than Sa * 59.
    Found = 0
    for S in (Lo 0) to (Hi 0)
      for T in (Lo 2) to (Hi 2)
        Rhs = 0 - C0 * S - C2 * T
        if Rhs mod C1 equal 0
          Q = Rhs // C1
          if Q at least (Lo 1) and Q at most (Hi 1)
            Found = 1
            break
          end
        end
      end
      if Found equal 1
        break
      end
    end
    if Found equal 1
      Cnt += 1
      if U * Bv greater Bu * V
        Bu = U
        Bv = V
      end
    end
  end
end
Pair = array Bu Bv
Answer = Pair join "/"
Answer print
